      "cooked": "<p>Fighting in Wagner Mars Base. Pervasive Red Dust is out. Every hero discards a card and then we can return something to the game. The only characters with an Equipment in the trash are Skyscraper and Wraith. SC works normally but Wraith has a Baterang in play and one in the trash.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Normally it would just try to put Razor Ordanace back into play, realize it is limited and not do it. What happens though is that nothing happens. I click Wraith to start the process and nothing happens.</p>",
